1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,960
The Institute was lost. Its secrets were not.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,740
Search Leyla's laboratory. Every object has a story.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,990
Read what only ultraviolet light can show.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,881
Restore the power. Open the hidden darkroom.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,572
Follow the light, and bend the beam.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,851
Beneath the archive, a vault is waiting.

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,398
And something below is... listening.

8
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:56,599
Mystery Room. Lost Institute.

